Package: bayesgrove
Title: Graph-Based Bayesian Workflow Scaffolding
Version: 0.7.0
Authors@R: c(person("Maximilian", "Scholz", email = "dev.scholz@mailbox.org", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Implements the bayesgrove workflow runtime with typed graph
    construction, deterministic fingerprinting, synchronous execution, content-
    addressed artifact storage, decision logging, a workflow protocol that
    reads typed diagnostic evidence and derives obligations, and built-in
    cmdstanr/brms executors that compute HMC, LOO, and PPC diagnostics
    themselves.
